A better 128-path optimization is weight layout. The fused projection kernel currently reads `[hidden, dim]` weights with a large stride across hidden columns; caching transposed `[dim, hidden]` weights should make the tensor-core operand loads coalesced. I’m patching that layout and adjusting the fused kernels’ weight offsets.
